{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ce57","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ad6d-f2e1-7d43-9e77-843c8eea6221"},"sequence":1414,"recorded_at":1780531400002823,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"9d656e52-9607-486f-955f-021a4f63ae37","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"9d656e52-9607-486f-955f-021a4f63ae37","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"9d656e52-9607-486f-955f-021a4f63ae37"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0ad76-d4be-7481-9e76-f50c0f74f698"},"task_id":"01a0ad76-d4be-7481-9e76-f50c0f74f698","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0ad76-d4be-7481-9e76-f50c0f74f698","chunk":"Read text file `/tmp/rev11base/logbook-candidate.patch`.\n1|diff --git a/LOGBOOK.md b/LOGBOOK.md\n2|index 57207fc..0e08aa7 100644\n3|--- a/LOGBOOK.md\n4|+++ b/LOGBOOK.md\n5|@@ -3,6 +3,89 @@\n6| > Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\n7| > Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n8| \n9|+## 2026-09-17\n10|+\n11|+### TASK-260909-2ez769 rework rev12 — exact interface call sites and side-effect-free binding refusal\n12|+- F1: the typed Config/Host Trust Store write-path census now allowlists interface edges by exact `*types.Func` identity plus source file/line/column, not by method spelling or enclosing-function membership. The inventory covers 119 production interface calls; the four pair-writer functions additionally require a top-level fail-fast hold guard before every admitted indirect write edge. Function-valued selectors and identifiers remain fail-closed except for named table entries; no non-callee interface method values were found in the production scan.\n13|+- F1 REGRESSION: `TestWritePathCensusRejectsUnlistedInterfaceCallSite` copies the module, plants real `filesystem.Rename` calls both before and after `requireHoldForConfig`, runs the real census, and proves the child rename witness executes before the census rejects both unlisted sites